<section id="faq">
  <div class="section-label">Common Questions</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
  <div class="faq-layout">
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">What size of businesses do you work with?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>We primarily work with MSMEs in the ₹5 crore to ₹500 crore revenue range. Large enough to have real operational complexity, yet agile enough to implement change quickly. We also work with supply chain divisions of larger corporates on project-specific engagements.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">How long does a typical engagement last?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>A diagnostic assessment typically takes 2–4 weeks. A full strategic planning engagement runs 6–12 weeks. Cost improvement and supply chain projects are usually 3–6 months. We also offer ongoing retainer arrangements for businesses that want continuous advisory support.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">How do you charge — fixed fee or daily rate?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>We offer both models. For well-defined projects, a fixed project fee provides budget certainty. For open-ended advisory, a monthly retainer or day-rate works better. We discuss this transparently during the discovery call — there are no surprises.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">Do you work on-site or remotely?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Both. The diagnostic phase and key workshops are conducted on-site — direct observation is irreplaceable. Ongoing advisory, analysis, and reporting can be handled remotely. We're based in Delhi NCR but travel across India for engagements.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">What results can I realistically expect?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Cost improvement projects typically deliver 15–30% reduction in targeted cost areas. Supply chain projects routinely cut inventory carrying costs by 20–40% and improve delivery reliability significantly. Strategic engagements build a clear 3-year roadmap — ROI materialises over 12–24 months.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-q-text">How does your ERP advisory work?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>We start with thorough process mapping before evaluating any ERP system. We create a vendor-neutral comparison across relevant platforms, facilitate structured demos, and score each option against your specific requirements. We have no referral arrangements with any ERP vendor — our recommendation is 100% objective.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-cta-box fade-in">
      <h3>Still have questions?</h3>
      <p>Every business situation is different. If your question isn't answered here, reach out directly — we're happy to have a straight conversation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact">Send a Message →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
